  "summary": "Air conditioning (C60) under-dash (passenger side) wiring and vacuum hoses: the A/C harness and vacuum hose bundle pass through grommets in the dash panel to the air selector duct, the diverter-door vacuum actuator (valve asm.) and the recirc-air actuator. The actuator is held to its bracket by two nuts with washers, and its link is screwed to the diverter door after the door is positioned. The right-hand courtesy lamp support is screwed into a nut asm. in a drilled hole in the air selector case.",
